{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "002D", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{J}$", "MATH_0003": "$M : \\mathcal{I} \\times \\mathcal{J} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$M_{i, \\infty} = \\colim_j M_{i,j}$", "MATH_0005": "$i$", "MATH_0006": "$M_{-, \\infty} : \\mathcal{I} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0007": "$M$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\colim_i \\colim_j M_{i, j}\n=\n\\colim_{i, j} M_{i, j}\n=\n\\colim_j \\colim_i M_{i, j}\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-colimits-commute}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ddf8d71aeb5a122a1d05251250608ae29257dc7d27e1eff42cd95d5fca21ae8b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4c5d4918e05a1d9cfe2d2d26e92e0a583392684d3dd52013eb35ac3e6c4150bc", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> be index categories. Let\n<MATH_0003> be a functor.\nAssume that <MATH_0004> \nexists for all <MATH_0005>. Then the resulting functor\n<MATH_0006>\nhas a colimit if and only if <MATH_0007> does, and then the colimits coincide.\nIn particular, we have\n<MATH_0008>\nprovided all the indicated colimits exist. Similar for limits.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9566e589c59260af68603eec5410d584ee7957b1ac803da337cf5a05c3ca1ce7", "unit_id": "tag:002M:statement"}
